{"id":"576c295ee467e0a8","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-bound-variable.md","title":"约束变量","display":"df-bound-variable — 约束变量","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-bound-variable","aliases":["28-df-bound-variable"],"display":"df-bound-variable — 约束变量","depends_on":["[[28-df-first-order-syntax]]","[[28-df-formula]]"],"source_status":"local-support-definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-bound-variable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-bound-variable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bound-variable — 约束变量"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"acf90b9de82eb78c\" href=\"?note=acf90b9de82eb78c\" title=\"28-df-first-order-syntax\">28-df-first-order-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" href=\"?note=d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" title=\"28-df-formula\">28-df-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"local-support-definition"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-bound-variable-—-约束变量-$\\mathrm{BV}(\\varphi)$\">df-bound-variable — 约束变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BV}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{BV}(\\varphi)\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(S,\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> 与有限语法树来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"acf90b9de82eb78c\" href=\"?note=acf90b9de82eb78c\" title=\"28-df-first-order-syntax\">28-df-first-order-syntax</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" href=\"?note=d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" title=\"28-df-formula\">28-df-formula</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sf},\\mathrm{BV}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sf},\\mathrm{BV}\\)</span> 在公式树上递归。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sf}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\{\\varphi\\}&amp;\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\\\\\{\\varphi\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sf}(\\psi)&amp;\\varphi=\\neg\\psi\\lor\\exists Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\;\\exists x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;\\varphi=Qx\\,\\psi\\\\\\{\\varphi\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sf}(\\psi)\\cup\\mathrm{Sf}(\\chi)&amp;\\varphi=(\\psi\\circ\\chi),\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sf}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\{\\varphi\\}&amp;\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\\\\\{\\varphi\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sf}(\\psi)&amp;\\varphi=\\neg\\psi\\lor\\exists Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\;\\exists x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;\\varphi=Qx\\,\\psi\\\\\\{\\varphi\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sf}(\\psi)\\cup\\mathrm{Sf}(\\chi)&amp;\\varphi=(\\psi\\circ\\chi),\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BV}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\mid\\exists Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\;\\exists\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;(Qx\\,\\chi)\\in\\mathrm{Sf}(\\varphi)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BV}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\mid\\exists Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\;\\exists\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;(Qx\\,\\chi)\\in\\mathrm{Sf}(\\varphi)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补足子公式算子的本地定义。这里统计绑定位置使用的变量名；某个变量名可以同时出现在自由位置与绑定位置，不以所有出现变量减自由变量来代替此定义。</p>\n<p>来源状态：本目录的自足支撑定义；不把此形式语言包装或模型论扩展冒称原书编号定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-bound-variable-—-约束变量-$\\mathrm{BV}(\\varphi)$","text":"df-bound-variable — 约束变量 $\\mathrm{BV}(\\varphi)$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-first-order-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"acf90b9de82eb78c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-first-order-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"d9d9a691a7b0cc03","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-first-order-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"acf90b9de82eb78c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,\\mathrm{Var}$ 与有限语法树来自 [[28-df-first-order-syntax]]；$\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 来自 [[28-df-formula]]。$\\mathrm{Sf},\\mathrm{BV}$ 在公式树上递归。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"d9d9a691a7b0cc03","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,\\mathrm{Var}$ 与有限语法树来自 [[28-df-first-order-syntax]]；$\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 来自 [[28-df-formula]]。$\\mathrm{Sf},\\mathrm{BV}$ 在公式树上递归。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{BV}(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"S,\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sf},\\mathrm{BV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sf}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\{\\varphi\\}&\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\\\\\{\\varphi\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sf}(\\psi)&\\varphi=\\neg\\psi\\lor\\exists Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\;\\exists x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;\\varphi=Qx\\,\\psi\\\\\\{\\varphi\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sf}(\\psi)\\cup\\mathrm{Sf}(\\chi)&\\varphi=(\\psi\\